description: >-
  Reproducible AMD ROCm 7.14 reference for serving Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B on
  Radeon gfx1151 (Strix Halo): dual-path validation (vLLM source build and
  llama.cpp HIP/Vulkan GGUF), a 28-cell benchmark matrix across both
  llama.cpp backends with UX-first verdicts, and evidence-linked
  documentation for every claim.
